lines = ["Welcome to the training lake, it is smaller compared to what you'll usually be working with on regular jobs.", 
"Your task is to clear the lake of all pests. For this lake there are 12 enemies in all.", "Since this is just training, the enemies will be pretty harmless, though they can still hurt you if you touch them.", "You have 3 days to complete this task, so you should have plenty of time.",
"The circle in the top right represents the time you have left in the day.", "If you're still out on the lake when the time runs out, just know we will leave you behind.", 
"So make sure to give yourself enough time to get to the dock before it's too late.", "You can interact with things by pressing SPACE/RIGHT CLICK.",
"And to attack, press LEFT CLICK, though you have to either be on your board or on land to attack.", 
"Speaking of the board it's that brown thing next to you.", "It's a little hard to manuever, but it allows you travel fast and doesn't leave you defenseless like swimming.",
"To dismount the board just press SPACE/RIGHT CLICK again.", "For now, head over to that patch of deep water in front of you and interact with it to dive underwater."];
i = 0;
text = lines[i];
